OL,3,AAsos app users tell BBC they are
OL,4,A'scared' after 'concerning' pop-up
OL,5,Amessage apparently from hackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FOur reporter asks Asos' chatbot whether
OL,8,Fher account is compromised - the bot
OL,9,Fsays "we're aware of the notification"
OL,10,Fand "investigating"
OL,12,FDid you get the notification? Here's
OL,13,Fwhat you should do
OL,15,FMeanwhile, shares in the company are
OL,16,Fdown, with Asos yet to comment on the
OL,17,Fincident
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
