OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATories pledge #10bn for British
OL,4,Aanti-missile defence system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tories initially said the system
OL,7,Fwould be "in essence a British 'Iron
OL,8,FDome'", likening it to Israel's missile
OL,9,Fshield, however party leader Kemi
OL,10,FBadenoch drew back from the comparison
OL,11,Fin broadcast interviews.
OL,13,FShe said the plan would be funded from
OL,14,Fwithin their commitment to spend 3% of
OL,15,FGDP on defence by 2030, paid for by
OL,16,Fwelfare reform and reprioritisation of
OL,17,Fother spending.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
